        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions Model #16DA-SPECIAL Large Cone Door Handle</b>\r\n<p>\r\nStunning design door pull handle  combines the traditional beauty of a large 1-1/2\" diameter Rope handle with very decorative cone finials. Used on both higher end residential and commercial door when a large easy to grab handle is required. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThis beautiful door handle is assembled in the USA by the expert craftsmen at First Impressions International, famous for high quality innovational pull handle designs. Available in 13 different finish colors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for First Impressions 16DA-SPECIAL Large Cone Door Handle\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Length:  26\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Rope Style Brass Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"made in the USA\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This large cone door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it - it can be custom designed to fit your specific door application in lengths up to 5 feet. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b>  Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\"><b>Contact Us</b></a> with your requirements.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Packaged Standard with Thrubolt mounting (Bolts thru the door). Optional Surface mounting or Back to Back mounting available (Pulls bolt to each other - Requires 2 door pulls).\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
